{"cid":11,"name":"Human Wizard","band":"20-39","tier":1,"lines":["Archmage","Soultaker","Arcana Lord"],"chain":[10,11],"group":"human_mystics","notes":["Guide §2 (shared band: Archmage, Soultaker, Arcana Lord). The \"Summon: see the line deltas in §3-§5\" row is expanded into the skills those deltas name (Kat 1111, Mew 1225, Servitor Heal 1127, Servitor Recharge 1126, Servitor Wind Walk 1144).","Archmage delta (§3.1) [rec]: summons are optional. Kat (1111) or Mew (1225) give extra damage, but they take a share of XP and stop levelling at 35 (Sorcerer does not learn them), so drop them at 40.","Soultaker delta (§4.1): Linedia (Necro H5) recommends Kat the Cat (1111) at 20-39 (solid damage, restores the master's MP). Unsummon it before the last hit on a boss (it takes about 30 % of XP). Heal it with Servitor Heal (1127) when its HP < 50 %. Mew is not recommended.","Arcana Lord delta (§5.1): from 20 the cat is the main damage. Summon Kat the Cat (1111) (tanky, returns MP to the master; oknologia, Asterios) rather than Mew (1225, large XP share; oknologia, linedia). Master: Servitor Heal (1127) at pet HP < 60 %, Servitor Recharge (1126, 25+) at pet MP < 30 %, Servitor Wind Walk (1144, 35) when the board pet buff is missing. The master nukes only to pull or help (Blaze).","Linedia (Necro H5) says skip Sleep, Poisonous Cloud, Curse Chaos, Surrender and Mew at this band. Slow is useless at 45+."],"rows":[{"a":"heal","id":1011,"n":"Heal","w":[],"when":{"hpBelow":75,"hpAbove":50,"outOfCombat":true},"auto":true,"def":true,"user":false,"tier":0,"from":"Human Mystic","cls":10,"o":4,"max":14,"learn":"7-14","rb":[],"trig":"Own HP 50-75 %, out of combat (7+). 5 s cast, cheaper.","why":"","src":"DP","lines":null},{"a":"groupheal","id":1027,"n":"Group Heal","w":[],"when":{"partyOnly":true,"alliesBelow":{"pct":70,"n":2}},"auto":true,"def":true,"user":false,"tier":0,"from":"Human Mystic","cls":10,"o":5,"max":14,"learn":"14-14","rb":[],"trig":"Party: 2+ members < 70 % (14+). 7 s cast, 